 "description": "Free. Initialize a watch cursor or check for new documented risk/lifecycle events for the same one to five mints. Returns availability only; a paid check returns event details and an updated cursor. Cursor lasts 24 h. Poll every 15 s or slower. Use it to watch held mints without paying; buy details only when it reports new events.",
